11:["$","p",null,{"children":"Today, our showroom carries massage chairs, leg massagers, and a comprehensive range of health care products. What hasn't changed is our approach: we'd rather spend twenty extra minutes with a customer explaining the difference between two chairs than sell the wrong one and deal with a return."}]
